---
title: "OAuth Authorization Code Flow (kintai-v3: OAuth Server)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_client_request: client app requests authorization
    q_client_request --> q_validate_client: lookup oauth.applications by client_id
    q_validate_client --> q_invalid_client: client not found or secret mismatch
    q_invalid_client --> [*]: return error (invalid client)
    q_validate_client --> q_check_redirect: client valid
    q_check_redirect --> q_bad_redirect: redirect_uri NOT IN application.redirect_uris
    q_bad_redirect --> [*]: return error (invalid redirect URI)
    q_check_redirect --> q_check_consent: redirect_uri valid
    q_check_consent --> q_consent_lookup: SELECT FROM oauth.user_consents WHERE user_id AND application_id
    q_consent_lookup --> q_need_consent: no existing consent
    q_need_consent --> q_show_consent: display consent page to user
    q_show_consent --> q_user_approves: user approves
    q_show_consent --> q_user_denies: user denies
    q_user_denies --> [*]: redirect with error=access_denied
    q_user_approves --> q_record_consent: INSERT oauth.user_consents(user_id, application_id, scope)
    q_consent_lookup --> q_generate_code: existing consent found
    q_record_consent --> q_generate_code: consent recorded
    q_generate_code --> q_create_code: INSERT oauth.authorization_codes(code, app_id, user_id, redirect_uri, code_challenge, expires_at=now+10min)
    q_create_code --> q_redirect_with_code: redirect to redirect_uri?code={code}
    q_redirect_with_code --> [*]: client receives authorization code

    note right of q_validate_client
        INV-001: client_secret stored as bcrypt hash (client_secret_hash)
        INV-002: Only admin users (is_admin=true) can register applications
        INV-003: RLS policy blocks all direct access to authorization_codes table
    end note

    note right of q_generate_code
        INV-004: Authorization code expires in 10 minutes
        INV-005: PKCE support via code_challenge and code_challenge_method (S256)
        INV-006: One consent per user per application (UNIQUE constraint)
        INV-007: user_consents allows user to DELETE own records (revoke consent)
    end note
